            "id": "790510101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's a diary here, and it looks really well preserved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790510102"
            ]
          },
          "790510102": {
            "id": "790510102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whew... now that's a relief!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790510103"
            ]
          },
          "790510103": {
            "id": "790510103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He untangled the knot in his heart, and improved his painting skills! Paimon thinks he'll definitely be really successful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790510104"
            ]
          },
          "790510104": {
            "id": "790510104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Though he left his Water Droplet friends behind, which sounds a bit sad to Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790510107"
            ]
          },
          "790510107": {
            "id": "790510107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, Paimon can understand that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790510108"
            ]
          },
          "790510108": {
            "id": "790510108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's still something that confuses Paimon. He mentioned in the diary that the mural can lose its shape and shift.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790510109"
            ]
          },
          "790510109": {
            "id": "790510109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But even after such a serious accident... the mural seems alright?"
          }
        }
      }
